<title>HONG KONG: Oriental Watch interim profit up 2.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Oriental Watch interim profit up 2.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   9.55   vs  9.36</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.2    vs  1.2</p>
